<title>MEXICO: RESEARCH ALERT - Comerci '96 EPS dropped.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Comerci '96 EPS dropped.</headline>
<dateline>MEXICO CITY 1997-02-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Mexican retailer Comercial Mexicana's 1996 earnings per share estimate was dropped to 0.828 pesos from 0.867 pesos on Friday by Abaco brokerage in Mexico City.</p>
<p>((--Mexico City newsroom +525 728-7903))</p>
</text>
